Here are some ideas for some venture capital funds that probably ought to be created, I just haven't done so yet. It's good to have focused targeted funds with a specific thesis.

**Human embryo engineering fund**: lots of companies will need to be created for [[designer babies|designer-baby-faq]].

**Brain uploading**: [[brain uploading]] will have lots of different venture opportunities.

**Longevity**: actually there are already several [[longevity]] venture capital funds, however I happen to think some of them they are misguided in their approaches to anti-aging, rejuvenation, longevity, etc.

**Fertility**: re-populating the earth with +100 billion humans should be a top priority; lots of economic reasons why expanding the size of the market is a good idea.

**Physical intelligence**: focus on [[biocomputing]], [[physical intelligence|projects/physical learning systems]], etc.


